WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.010
Not by chance — by formation.

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:05.370
Here, character is forged
in community.

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:08.920
Excellence is expected,
not optional.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.870
Faith is lived,
not merely taught.

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:15.880
Class of 2031 —
you do not arrive as strangers.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.860
You arrive as the next chapter
of a proven tradition.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:22.460
Parents — you are placing your
child in a safe environment.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.800
A place that has already done

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:26.990
this important work
for generations.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.660
Welcome home.

